    "The appearance of the Golden Christian Fish sign breaking into his private world from outside",
    "A specific narrowly-defined highly specific act under precise circumstances that terminated his exile from the Garden",
    "Personal mystical experience of divine illumination 'last night especially' on the vertical axis",
    "Seeing the maze and realizing the self-generated nature of the world",
    "Recollection of having been exiled from another world and being restored to it"
  ],
